      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In Introducing Amazon SageMaker HyperPod Inference Gateway , we showed how the Inference Gateway gives each Amazon SageMaker HyperPod cluster a single, GPU-aware endpoint.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, SageMaker HyperPod introduces the Global Inference Gateway.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It is one SageMaker-managed gateway that routes across every cluster you register, in one Region or across Regions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Global Inference Gateway is the second tier of the architecture we described in part 1.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Consider a team that serves four models across five HyperPod clusters in two Regions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Without the Inference Gateway, clients track 20 endpoints: one per model per cluster.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In our beta tests, the Global Inference Gateway in Amazon SageMaker HyperPod routed requests across two AWS Regions through a single endpoint and kept serving them when one cluster could no longer serve the model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Figure 1: The Global Inference Gateway receives each request at one regional endpoint and forwards it over AWS PrivateLink to the best HyperPod cluster, where the cluster’s Inference Gateway routes it to a model pod.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, we introduced the Amazon SageMaker HyperPod Global Inference Gateway: one SageMaker-managed endpoint across your HyperPod clusters, in one Region or several.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-global-inference-gateway-one-endpoint-across-regions-and-clusters/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-20T22:35:24.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:25:52.906Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Global Inference Gateway is available in 13 AWS Regions: US East (N.",
